10 REM NEAL-PITTEWAY CONCENTRIC CIRCLES, DRAWN WITH PLOT
20 REM X=X-E/2*Y : Y=Y+E*X : X=X-E/2*Y
30 GCLEAR
40 REM ---- SCALE MAPS ITS WINDOW ONTO 256x243 PIXELS, SO A SQUARE WINDOW ----
50 REM ---- DRAWS OVALS. 270 UNITS ACROSS TO 256 DOWN IS THE ROUND ONE. ----
60 SCALE -135,135,-128,128
70 FOR R=1 TO 5
80 RD=R*24
90 REM ---- N STEPS OF E RADIANS CLOSE THE RING, SO E IS SET FROM N ----
100 N=20+R*20
110 E=6.2832/N
120 X=RD
130 Y=0
140 MOVE X,Y
150 FOR A=1 TO N
160 X=X-E/2*Y
170 Y=Y+E*X
180 X=X-E/2*Y
190 PLOT X,Y
200 NEXT A
210 NEXT R
220 IF INKEY=255 THEN 220
230 GOTO 30
